":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/deployments","created_at":"2026-11-20T22:59:28Z","updated_at":"2026-11-21T05:16:45Z","pushed_at":"2026-11-21T06:05:38Z","git_url":"git://github.com/dbeallor/album-ranker.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:dbeallor/album-ranker.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/dbeallor/album-ranker.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/dbeallor/album-ranker","homepage":null,"size":164,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"language":"TypeScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":0,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":11,"license":null,"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":11,"watchers":0,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":true,"maintain":true,"push":true,"triage":true,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/pulls/23","html_url":"https://github.com/dbeallor/album-ranker/pull/23","diff_url":"https://github.com/dbeallor/album-ranker/pull/23.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/dbeallor/album-ranker/pull/23.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Summary\n\n`npm run preview` runs the app from `main` (port 4000) and from any ticket's worktree (port 4000 + N) side by side, each with its own SQLite file. Adds `list`, `stop`, per-worktree setup, taken-port errors, README steps and a note in `docs/agents/project.md`.\n\n- Ticket: [ALBUM-20](https://github.com/dbeallor/album-ranker/issues/20)\n- Spec: `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-21-album-20-local-previews.md`\n\nCloses #20\n\n## Proof\n\nRun by the implementer on this branch (macOS, Node 26), main preview from the root checkout and ticket 20 from this worktree.\n\n- **One command starts main on its fixed port**: `npm run preview -- main` ran `npm install` and built in the root checkout, served on 4000 in about 12 s, root stayed on `main`; `curl localhost:4000/` returned 200.\n- **One command per ticket on a different port, main keeps running**: `npm run preview -- 20 --empty` came up on 4020 while main ran; `npm run preview -- list` showed both with pid and commit; `curl` returned 200 on 4000 and 4020.\n- **Ticket data changes don't reach main**: a temporary uncommitted route wrote a `proof_rows` table through 4020. It appeared in this worktree's `data/preview.db`; the root's `data/album-ranker.db`, `-wal` and `-shm` kept the same checksums and sizes. The route was removed.\n- **Data options**: a restart without flags kept `proof_rows`; `20 --copy-main-data` replaced the file with a copy of main's (19 tables, `proof_rows` gone) while main was running.\n- **Taken port fails clearly**: `20 --port 4000` printed `Port 4000 is in use by the preview of main (pid ...)` and `Stop it with: npm run preview -- stop main`; an unrelated listener on 4555 printed `Port 4555 is in use.` and `lsof -i :4555`. Both exit 1.\n- **Stop and refresh**: `stop 20` freed 4020 and `list` showed only main; running `main` again replaced its pid and served 200; `stop main` freed 4000; `stop all` with nothing running reported so.\n- **Bad input**: `99` (no worktree), `--empty --copy-main-data`, `main --empty` and `--port 80` were each rejected with a clear message.\n- **Setup per checkout**: the first main run copied `.env.example` to `.env` and ran `npm install` in the root.\n- **Nothing from `data/`, `.env` or `.preview/` committed**: `.preview/` added to `.gitignore`; `data/`, `.env*` and `*.db` were already ignored.\n- **Checks**: `npm test` 17 files, 190 tests passed (59 new table-driven cases in `scripts/preview/rules.test.ts`); `npm run lint`, `npm run typecheck` and `npm run build` clean at c3b57ba.\n\nNot proven:\n- \"README steps work from a fresh checkout\": the steps were run from the existing checkouts, not a fresh clone.\n- Start timeouts (3 min main, 1 min ticket) and the log tail and kill on a failed start: not triggered by hand.\n- Two worktrees matching one ticket number, and a branch without a ticket number needing `--port`: covered by unit tests only.\n- Hand checks ran on macOS only.\n\nContext size: pass skipped (not collective-wisdom)\n\nSide effect worth knowing: running the main preview wrote `node_modules/`, `.env`, `.next/`, `data/album-ranker.db` and `.preview/` into the root checkout, which is what the command is for. All are gitignored once this merges.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/issues/23/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/issues/23/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":36841636904,"node_id":"LE_lADOV2EaVs8AAAABhO2DFc8AAAAIk-7EKA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/issues/events/36841636904","actor":{"login":"dbeallor","id":25851246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODUxMjQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25851246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbeallor","html_url":"https://github.com/dbeallor","followers